    {
      "section": "CODEOWNERS for DSH",
      "text": "> Read-only file-to-owner routing with GitHub-style last-match-wins CODEOWNERS patterns."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "```bash\nnode bin/dsh-codeowners.mjs --root . docs/a.md src/a.js\nnode bin/dsh-codeowners.mjs --root . --json\n```\n\nIn DSH:\n\n```text\nUse codeowners_lookup with root=. and the changed files.\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Limits",
      "text": "- Routing helper, not approval/enforcement\n- No GitHub API, owner validation, or branch protection\n- Practical glob subset; test unusual patterns"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tests",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm test\n```"
